testPreparedParameterMetadata;req;r;db;con;stmt;cnt;nm1;nm2;nm3;lt
⍝ Isolated test for prepared-parameter metadata wrappers with bounds guards.

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Prepared Parameter Metadata Wrappers'

db←open ':memory:'
con←connect db
stmt←prepareQuery con 'SELECT $1, $2, $3'
r,←⊂'Prepare statement for parameter metadata wrappers' req stmt≠0

:If stmt≠0
    cnt←parameterCount stmt
    r,←⊂'parameterCount returns 3' req 3=cnt

    nm1←stmt parameterName 1
    nm2←stmt parameterName 2
    nm3←stmt parameterName 3
    r,←⊂'parameterName(1) call returned' req 2=⎕NC'nm1'
    r,←⊂'parameterName(2) call returned' req 2=⎕NC'nm2'
    r,←⊂'parameterName(3) call returned' req 2=⎕NC'nm3'

    r,←⊂'parameterType(1) call returned' req (stmt parameterType 1)∊⍳32
    r,←⊂'parameterType(2) call returned' req (stmt parameterType 2)∊⍳32
    r,←⊂'parameterType(3) call returned' req (stmt parameterType 3)∊⍳32

    lt←stmt parameterLogicalType 1
    r,←⊂'parameterLogicalType(1) call returned (nullable pre-bind)' req (lt=0)∨lt≠0
    :If lt≠0
        {}api.duckdb_destroy_logical_type ⊂lt
    :EndIf

    ⍝ Guarded out-of-range
    r,←⊂'parameterName(out-of-range) guarded empty' req 0=≢stmt parameterName cnt+1
    r,←⊂'parameterType(out-of-range) guarded INVALID' req type.INVALID=stmt parameterType cnt+1
    r,←⊂'parameterLogicalType(out-of-range) guarded null' req 0=stmt parameterLogicalType cnt+1

    {}destroyPrepared stmt
:EndIf

⍝ Null guards
r,←⊂'parameterCount(null) guarded zero' req 0=parameterCount 0
r,←⊂'parameterName(null) guarded empty' req 0=≢0 parameterName 1
r,←⊂'parameterType(null) guarded INVALID' req type.INVALID=0 parameterType 1
r,←⊂'parameterLogicalType(null) guarded null' req 0=0 parameterLogicalType 1

{}disconnect con
{}close db

⎕←↑r
⎕←''
⎕←'Prepared parameter metadata wrapper testing complete!'

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
